# Vendored third-party sources. This has to exist *before* they are committed, or Git normalizes
# them later and the fix becomes its own churn commit.
#
#   -text             Git for Windows defaults to core.autocrlf=true, which would rewrite every
#                     one of these LF files to CRLF on checkout. Store and check out bytes as-is.
#   -diff             a version bump touches ~1500 files; show "Binary files differ" instead.
#   linguist-vendored keep GitHub's language stats about this engine, not about SDL.
Vendor/*/Source/** -text -diff linguist-vendored
Vendor/*/Include/** -text -diff linguist-vendored
